 "notes": "Upper limits (95% C.L.) on the electromagnetic gauge modulus coupling de obtained from AURIGA resonant-mass detector. Data from August 2015 acquisition. Masses probed: 3.1-4.5\u00d710^-12 eV. The curve represents the lower envelope of the observed limit, with minimum coupling 3.3\u00d710^-6 at mass ~3.9\u00d710^-12 eV, consistent with the paper's statement of limits 'better than 10^-5'. Paper assumes standard DM halo model with \u03c1_DM = 0.3 GeV/cm\u00b3. Figure 5 shows this limit applies equally to both de (electromagnetic) and dme (electron mass) modulus couplings. Extracted from vector figure by red-pixel identification and calibration using axis ranges.",
